### `.keyof()`

To create a `ZodEnum` schema from the keys of an object schema:

<Tabs groupId="lib" items={["Zod", "Zod Mini"]}>
<Tab value="Zod">
```ts
const keySchema = Dog.keyof();
// => ZodEnum<["name", "age"]>
```
