      node16 (from ESM): 🎭 Masquerading as CJS
      bundler: 🟢 

      ***********************************

      "zod/locales"

      node10: 🟢 
      node16 (from CJS): 🟢 (CJS)
      node16 (from ESM): 🎭 Masquerading as CJS
      bundler: 🟢 

      ***********************************

      "zod/v3"

      node10: 🟢 
      node16 (from CJS): 🟢 (CJS)
      node16 (from ESM): 🎭 Masquerading as CJS
      bundler: 🟢 

      ***********************************

      "zod/v4"

      node10: 🟢 
      node16 (from CJS): 🟢 (CJS)
      node16 (from ESM): 🎭 Masquerading as CJS
      bundler: 🟢 

      ***********************************

